---
import LegalPageLayout from "../layouts/LegalPageLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<LegalPageLayout
  title="Website Disclaimer | Global Bash Tax Services"
  description="Important limitations concerning tax information and services described on the Global Bash website."
  heading="Website and Tax Information Disclaimer"
  canonicalPath="/website-disclaimer/"
  effectiveDate="August 9, 2026"
>
  <h2>General Information Only</h2>

  <p>
    Website content provides general information about
    Global Bash and its services. It is not individualized
    tax, legal, accounting, financial, investment, or real
    estate advice.
  </p>

  <h2>No Professional Relationship</h2>

  <p>
    Viewing the website, sending a message, or requesting a
    consultation does not create a professional
    relationship.
  </p>

  <h2>No Guaranteed Outcome</h2>

  <p>
    Global Bash does not guarantee a refund, deduction,
    credit, tax reduction, approval by a tax authority, or
    any other result.
  </p>

  <h2>Client Information</h2>

  <p>
    Tax preparation depends on complete, accurate, and
    timely information supplied by the client.
  </p>

  <h2>Tax Notices and Representation</h2>

  <p>
    References to tax-notice assistance do not promise
    audit, appeals, collections, litigation, or legal
    representation. The precise service must be reviewed
    and accepted before work begins.
  </p>

  <h2>Credentials and Scope</h2>

  <p>
    Milana Bash is presented as an IRS-registered tax
    return preparer and MBA. The website does not represent
    her as a CPA, enrolled agent, or attorney.
  </p>

  <h2>Electronic Communications</h2>

  <p>
    Standard website forms and ordinary email are not
    approved for sending Social Security numbers, bank
    information, tax returns, identity documents, or other
    sensitive information.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <address>
    Email:
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
      {site.email}
    </a><br />

    Phone:
    <a href={site.phoneHref}>
      {site.phoneDisplay}
    </a>
  </address>
</LegalPageLayout>